{"id": "Ugx53FDeBB7tlbuvkdx4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 24, "text": "세월은건강지켜주지않는다.남은돈모두쓰고.즐건시간되어야합니다", "published": "2026-10-04T08:12:38", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
